DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
17220::$$$message_0130_0000_0000$$$::"...Why are you sitting next to me, kid?"[lr]::
17221::$$$message_0130_0000_0001$$$::"You're the one who came over here, Lancer."[lr]::
17222::$$$message_0130_0000_0002$$$::Why the heck am I sitting with Lancer on a park bench?[lr]::
17223::$$$message_0130_0000_0003$$$::...He's the one who came next to me while mumbling; I was here first.::
17224::$$$message_0130_0001_0000$$$::"I see. I have no interest in sitting with guys."[lr]::
17225::$$$message_0130_0001_0001$$$::"Sorry, I'm a guy. Would you be fine with it if I was a girl?"::
17226::$$$message_0130_0002_0000$$$::"I'd welcome it. I'd have her sit on top of me rather than with me."[lr]::
17227::$$$message_0130_0002_0001$$$::"Wha...!"[lr]::
17228::$$$message_0130_0002_0002$$$::"What? Don't blush every time over this stuff.[lr]::
17229::$$$message_0130_0002_0003$$$::You've got them on you, right?"[lr]::
17230::$$$message_0130_0002_0004$$$::"S-S-S-Stu...!"[lr]::
17231::$$$message_0130_0002_0005$$$::I'm not blushing, and I [font italic=true]do[font italic=false] have them on me![lr]::
17232::$$$message_0130_0002_0006$$$::...I can't scream such a thing out loud. This is a park for everyone.::
17233::$$$message_0130_0003_0000$$$::"Do you though? Can't you at least say something smooth like you'll let them sit on you, or you'll sit on them instead?"[lr]::
17234::$$$message_0130_0003_0001$$$::"That's not tasteful, that's just sexual harassment!"[lr]::
17235::$$$message_0130_0003_0002$$$::"...What is that? A weapon? Food?"::
17236::$$$message_0130_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17237::$$$message_0130_0004_0001$$$::Explaining the concept of sexual harassment to a Heroic Spirit from the mythical age.[lr]::
17238::$$$message_0130_0004_0002$$$::It's impossible. It's as impossible as explaining the structure of the Internet to Tohsaka.[lr]::
17239::$$$message_0130_0004_0003$$$::Even if I do explain it to him, he'll probably laugh it off.[lr]::
17240::$$$message_0130_0004_0004$$$::Lancer is from a world where forced marriage is the norm.::
17241::$$$message_0130_0005_0000$$$::"So.[lr]::
17242::$$$message_0130_0005_0001$$$::Why the heck am I alone with you, kid?"[lr]::
17243::$$$message_0130_0005_0002$$$::"Why don't you go fishing like you usually do?"[lr]::
17244::$$$message_0130_0005_0003$$$::"There ain't no good ones swimming today..."[wvs][se storage=se054.wav][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=3][clfg textoff=0 rule=走る感じ pos=all time=300]::
17245::$$$message_0130_0006_0000$$$::Lancer must've had his eyes on something, as he swiftly and naturally leaves the bench.::
17246::$$$message_0130_0007_0000$$$::"Hey, hey, do you girls have some time?"[lr]::
17247::$$$message_0130_0007_0001$$$::...Here he goes.[lr]::
17248::$$$message_0130_0007_0002$$$::I wonder what kind of girl he called to this time.[lr]::
17249::$$$message_0130_0007_0003$$$::There seem to be several of them, since he said "you girls"...::
17250::$$$message_0130_0008_0000$$$::"Huh? Huh? U-Us?"[lr]::
17251::$$$message_0130_0008_0001$$$::"It must be us if he said 'you girls.'"[lr]::
17252::$$$message_0130_0008_0002$$$::"...Who are you?"[lr]::
17253::$$$message_0130_0008_0003$$$::It was the members of the track team...!::
17254::$$$message_0130_0009_0000$$$::"Me? I'm not some creeper."[lr]::
17255::$$$message_0130_0009_0001$$$::"What is your name?"[lr]::
17256::$$$message_0130_0009_0002$$$::"Well, call me Lancer. But if you don't want to, you can also call me the Blue Panther of Fuyuki."[lr]::
17257::$$$message_0130_0009_0003$$$::"Oho, you're saying that knowing I'm Fuyuki's black panther, right?"::
17258::$$$message_0130_0010_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=由紀香私服02c(遠) textoff=0]The self-proclaimed black panther, Makidera, reacts to Lancer's statement.[lr]::
17259::$$$message_0130_0010_0001$$$::Their conversation should be nonsensical, but it strangely seems to add up.[lr]::
17260::$$$message_0130_0010_0002$$$::...Those two might actually get along pretty well.::
17261::$$$message_0130_0011_0000$$$::"Oh, you're the black panther. I was thinking I wanted to meet you someday."[lr]::
17262::$$$message_0130_0011_0001$$$::"Huh...oh, well, [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服03c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服03c(遠) textoff=0]everyone says that, but I'm not really[line len=2]"[lr]::
17263::$$$message_0130_0011_0002$$$::"You're famous, Maki."[lr]::
17264::$$$message_0130_0011_0003$$$::"...I thought only Makidera was saying that herself, but the world sure is a big place."[lr]::
17265::$$$message_0130_0011_0004$$$::No, I'm pretty sure Lancer heard it for the first time, too.::
17266::$$$message_0130_0012_0000$$$::"So, is this pretty woman and cute girl your acquaintances, Black Panther?"[lr]::
17267::$$$message_0130_0012_0001$$$::"Oh, yes, we are Maki's friends."[lr]::
17268::$$$message_0130_0012_0002$$$::"Yes, Himuro and Yukika. We're in the same club and..."::
17269::$$$message_0130_0013_0000$$$::"Wait, you don't have to tell me.[lr]::
17270::$$$message_0130_0013_0001$$$::Hm... You're fast at running, aren't you, Black Panther?"[lr]::
17271::$$$message_0130_0013_0002$$$::"Huh? Y-You can tell? Hahaha."[lr]::
17272::$$$message_0130_0013_0003$$$::"You have a nice body.[lr]::
17273::$$$message_0130_0013_0004$$$::Pretty impressive. If you're training that much, it's natural you're known as the black panther more than anything."::
17274::$$$message_0130_0014_0000$$$::Mrgh... What's with that smooth talking? There's dandiness within his wildness.[lr]::
17275::$$$message_0130_0014_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服03c(遠) textoff=0]Next, Lancer quickly observes Himuro.::
17276::$$$message_0130_0015_0000$$$::"That woman there is all about the jumping, not the speed... Not horizontally, but vertically."[lr]::
17277::$$$message_0130_0015_0001$$$::"...Oh, you're right. You've got quite an eye."[lr]::
17278::$$$message_0130_0015_0002$$$::"And, that girl is... [cacheimage storage=ランサー私服01e(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=ランサー私服01e(遠) textoff=0]Oh..."[lr]::
17279::$$$message_0130_0015_0003$$$::Saegusa is a manager and isn't athletic.[lr]::
17280::$$$message_0130_0015_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=氷室私服02a(遠) textoff=0]Lancer is trying to analyze which track event she's good at and seems to be having trouble.::
17281::$$$message_0130_0016_0000$$$::"Oh, I'm the manager. Kane is the high jump ace, and Maki is the ace of middle-distance."[lr]::
17282::$$$message_0130_0016_0001$$$::"It seems like you do track too, but what's your event?"[lr]::
17283::$$$message_0130_0016_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ランサー私服01c(遠) textoff=0]Makidera seems to completely believe he's involved with track and field, or... Is she happy that she's being hit on by a guy?[lr]::
17284::$$$message_0130_0016_0003$$$::Whatever the case, it's true that Lancer is a fine man. Even though it's frustrating.::
17285::$$$message_0130_0017_0000$$$::"Me? I'm good at javelin throwing."[lr]::
17286::$$$message_0130_0017_0001$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Guh...!"[lr]::
17287::$$$message_0130_0017_0002$$$::...That's not something you're just good at!::
17288::$$$message_0130_0018_0000$$$::"Oh, you actually do athletics? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服04a(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服04a(遠) textoff=0]I'm glad."[lr]::
17289::$$$message_0130_0018_0001$$$::"Javelin throwing, so like Kubota."[lr]::
17290::$$$message_0130_0018_0002$$$::"Oh, you look as though you are quite good at it, but what is your record?"[lr]::
17291::$$$message_0130_0018_0003$$$::It flies at a speed of Mach 2 for a distance of about 40 kilometers.::
17292::$$$message_0130_0019_0000$$$::...No, more than that, Lancer's spear can probably hit a target that's even on the opposite side of the earth.[lr]::
17293::$$$message_0130_0019_0001$$$::I'm worried that Lancer might say something careless to the three girls that don't know about his situation...::
17294::$$$message_0130_0020_0000$$$::"Yeah... Well, there aren't many that can beat me. Maybe two or three under certain conditions."[lr]::
17295::$$$message_0130_0020_0001$$$::His frivolous talk has an incredible amount of credibility to it.[lr]::
17296::$$$message_0130_0020_0002$$$::The girls that don't know the matters don't feel that Lancer is being conceited at all.::
17297::$$$message_0130_0021_0000$$$::"Wow, that's amazing. I'm jealous, ahh."[lr]::
17298::$$$message_0130_0021_0001$$$::"I see, you have enough skill to call yourself Fuyuki's panther. Same. You're the same as me. Hehehe."[lr]::
17299::$$$message_0130_0021_0002$$$::Makidera wants to say that she's also impressive.::
17300::$$$message_0130_0022_0000$$$::That aside, Lancer and the three girls strangely seem to have a lot in common.[lr]::
17301::$$$message_0130_0022_0001$$$::Could he actually succeed in hitting on them...!?::
17302::$$$message_0130_0023_0000$$$::"Well, why don't we talk about that more in detail?"[lr]::
17303::$$$message_0130_0023_0001$$$::"That is...are you inviting us?"[lr]::
17304::$$$message_0130_0023_0002$$$::"Huh, w-what should we do, Maki!?"[lr]::
17305::$$$message_0130_0023_0003$$$::"Mm, isn't it fine? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服03c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服03c(遠) textoff=0]We are free after all."[lr]::
17306::$$$message_0130_0023_0004$$$::Makidera is in a very good mood after being complimented.::
17307::$$$message_0130_0024_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ランサー私服01a(遠) textoff=0]...Himuro is still wary and Saegusa is surprised about the turn of events, but the flow of things are in Lancer's favor.[lr]::
17308::$$$message_0130_0024_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Oh, am I going to witness his first success at picking up girls!?[font italic=false][lr]::
17309::$$$message_0130_0024_0002$$$::But I can't let my school friends... Well, there's one that's on the fence, but... I can't let them fall prey to him...!::
17310::$$$message_0130_0025_0000$$$::"Hey, Himuro. This person seems rather strong and weird, right? I want to hear his stories. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺私服02c(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺私服02c(遠)]I want him to hang with us."[lr]::
17311::$$$message_0130_0025_0001$$$::"Indeed...well, I don't know what you'll do if I don't go. I shall keep you company."[lr]::
17312::$$$message_0130_0025_0002$$$::"I-Is it okay if I tag along, too?"[lr]::
17313::$$$message_0130_0025_0003$$$::"Please do, young lady...you're cute, do you have a boyfriend?"[lr]::
17314::$$$message_0130_0025_0004$$$::Lancer is excited.[lr]::
17315::$$$message_0130_0025_0005$$$::Saegusa's all red...poor thing.::
17316::$$$message_0130_0026_0000$$$::"I-I don't..."[lr]::
17317::$$$message_0130_0026_0001$$$::"Mister, Yukicchi is pure so you can't bully her."[lr]::
17318::$$$message_0130_0026_0002$$$::"Oh, sorry about that.[lr]::
17319::$$$message_0130_0026_0003$$$::Why don't we get going then?"[lr]::
17320::$$$message_0130_0026_0004$$$::Congratulations, Lancer.[lr]::
17321::$$$message_0130_0026_0005$$$::Clapping softly, I get up from the bench.[lr]::
17322::$$$message_0130_0026_0006$$$::Also sorry, Lancer.[lr]::
17323::$$$message_0130_0026_0007$$$::Even if heaven allows you to hit on them, I won't allow it...!::
17324::$$$message_0130_0027_0000$$$::"Hm...oh, Emiya?[lr]::
17325::$$$message_0130_0027_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺私服01e(遠) textoff=0]Why are you making a sour face?"[lr]::
17326::$$$message_0130_0027_0002$$$::"Oh? Emiya?"[lr]::
17327::$$$message_0130_0027_0003$$$::"Emiya?"[lr]::
17328::$$$message_0130_0027_0004$$$::"...Shoot. Do you guys know each other?"[lr]::
17329::$$$message_0130_0027_0005$$$::"Yeah. Then, you know what I'm here to do, right, Lancer?"::
17330::$$$message_0130_0028_0000$$$::"Come on, it's fine if it's before I set a trap, but you can't stop me once I've already pulled them in. That's also rude to the ladies."[lr]::
17331::$$$message_0130_0028_0001$$$::"Mrgh."[lr]::
17332::$$$message_0130_0028_0002$$$::That's reasonable.[lr]::
17333::$$$message_0130_0028_0003$$$::Lancer is determined to follow through on his catch as a pickup artist.::
17334::$$$message_0130_0029_0000$$$::"...Then, when would you back down?"[lr]::
17335::$$$message_0130_0029_0001$$$::"Obviously, that would probably be when the ladies have defeated me."[lr]::
17336::$$$message_0130_0029_0002$$$::"...All right. Don't forget what you just said."[lr]::
17337::$$$message_0130_0029_0003$$$::Then there's a way. It's hopeless in battle, but there's a special trump card if it's picking up girls...!::
17338::$$$message_0130_0030_0000$$$::"Hey, Himuro."[lr]::
17339::$$$message_0130_0030_0001$$$::"...What? It seems like you know that person, but is he a dangerous man?"[lr]::
17340::$$$message_0130_0030_0002$$$::"...That I don't know yet. He's a good guy, so I don't think he would do anything weird... But, you never know.[lr]::
17341::$$$message_0130_0030_0003$$$::Honestly, if that happens, there's only six people who can help in Fuyuki City."::
17342::$$$message_0130_0031_0000$$$::"...That's troublesome.[lr]::
17343::$$$message_0130_0031_0001$$$::I guess it's wise to turn him down here."[lr]::
17344::$$$message_0130_0031_0002$$$::"...No. There's a special way to ambush him. If things go wrong..."::
17345::$$$message_0130_0032_0000$$$::I whisper in her ear.[lr]::
17346::$$$message_0130_0032_0001$$$::"Huh? Is that really it?"[lr]::
17347::$$$message_0130_0032_0002$$$::"Yeah. And after you're done, make sure to say the name."[lr]::
17348::$$$message_0130_0032_0003$$$::"Got it. That sounds like something even we can do."::
17349::$$$message_0130_0033_0000$$$::"Hey, are you guys done talking?"[lr]::
17350::$$$message_0130_0033_0001$$$::"Yeah. Do as you like."[lr]::
17351::$$$message_0130_0033_0002$$$::"All right, let's get going, ladies![lr]::
17352::$$$message_0130_0033_0003$$$::It's almost noon, let's get something to eat. My treat, of course."[lr]::
17353::$$$message_0130_0033_0004$$$::"Nice! I want McG! I want you to treat me till I'm full of McG!"[lr]::
17354::$$$message_0130_0033_0005$$$::"T-Thank you!"[lr]::
17355::$$$message_0130_0033_0006$$$::"Oh... That's perfect."::
17356::$$$message_0130_0034_0000$$$::The four leave the park, getting along.[lr]::
17357::$$$message_0130_0034_0001$$$::As they're leaving, Himuro gives me a thumbs-up.[lr]::
17358::$$$message_0130_0034_0002$$$::...So.[lr]::
17359::$$$message_0130_0034_0003$$$::Less than ten minutes of basking in the sun later...[lr]::
17360::$$$message_0130_0034_0004$$$::"AHHHHHH!!![lr]::
17361::$$$message_0130_0034_0005$$$::W-W-W-WHAT ARE YOU MAKING ME EATTTT!?"[lr]::
17362::$$$message_0130_0034_0006$$$::I hear a refreshing scream echo throughout the blue sky.::
17363::$$$message_0130_0035_0000$$$::Lancer runs towards the port with the force of a raging bull.[lr]::
17364::$$$message_0130_0035_0001$$$::"Heh. Heheheh, heheheheh...!"[lr]::
17365::$$$message_0130_0035_0002$$$::What I whispered into Himuro's ear was simple.[lr]::
17366::$$$message_0130_0035_0003$$$::If he starts to act funny, find some excuse to make him eat a hot dog...::
17367::$$$message_0130_0036_0000$$$::"But... It's good that it's immediately effective, but the operation was put into action after only ten minutes?[lr]::
17368::$$$message_0130_0036_0001$$$::Even though you're my enemy, I gotta admit that you're a frightening guy, Lancer."[lr]::
17369::$$$message_0130_0036_0002$$$::Now.[lr]::
17370::$$$message_0130_0036_0003$$$::I get up from the bench and head to the closest fast food place.[lr]::
17371::$$$message_0130_0036_0004$$$::I might as well have lunch at Culann's guard dog's place of defeat while I'm at it.::

